# Un'Goro Crater - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 3 rank-flagged rares of Un'Goro (zone
# key 1449), verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# npc/object/item dumps). Every goal is optional - a missing spawn never
# wedges the guide. All three rares hold single points, so every step is a
# plain single-goto step; no step loops. No rare drops signature loot (all
# tables are shared world drops), so no collect goals ship here. No quests
# take any shipped rare as a target, and no core quest names any shipped
# rare. Rank-2 elites Gruff and King Mosh carry roles ["rare"] but stay out
# per the Felwood/Azshara rank rule (see the inventory doc - Mosh's
# sole-source Devilcore patterns still ship in the recipes companion).
# No tame lines: no data flag, no drop evidence, no core-guide corroboration
# (see docs/companion-unverified.md). No treasure ships: the data holds no
# chest-named object in 1449 besides core-owned 164910 Ornate Chest, and the
# fixed dirt piles, bones, carcasses and crystal formations carry no
# lootability flag - the guide is rares-only and says so (see
# docs/ungoro-companions-inventory.md).
guide butler-routes-completionist/ungoro-rares
title Un'Goro Crater - Rares & Treasures
levels 47-54
zone Un'Goro Crater
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords ungoro, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

