  zone map 1449

  goto 48.73,85.35
  kill 6582 optional
  note Clutchmother Zavas (level 54 ravasaur) holds a single south-crater point. No signature loot in the data - shared world drops only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step East coast - Uhk'loc

  zone map 1449

  goto 68.48,12.66
  kill 6585 optional
  note Uhk'loc (level 53 gorilla) holds a single east-coast point. No signature loot in the data - shared world drops only (gems, ore, generic world-drop recipes).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

# Rank-2 elites Gruff and King Mosh carry roles ["rare"] but rank 2, not
